        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_09ce0f61",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "……",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 2,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 3,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_5d1a4a88",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "三纪神话研究 · 第一纪",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 3,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 4,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_8509a533",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "在罗伊神话中的旧日纪，人类能够借助太阳与星辰沟通，知晓世界的运转规律，人们的世界也因此温暖富足。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 4,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 5,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_0f8d438b",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "但在旧日纪的末尾，一场灾害导致大地塌陷，世界坠入冰冷渊狱，帮助人类沟通的神明朔尔亦被汹涌的浪潮困于高天。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 5,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 6,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_792eaf05",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "罗伊人从此失去了与宇宙对话的媒介，如迷失在冰雪中的旅人。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 6,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 7,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_60e1d9b7",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "传说中，朔尔的瞳孔化为了陨石，亦被称作「朔尔之眼」或「指日石」，它能帮助罗伊人在风雪蔽日时确定太阳的方向。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 7,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 8,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_b5b11ece",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "据笔者考察，「朔尔之眼」的原型是衍光矿，基于其特殊的光学性质，可用于判断持有人当前位置与炉芯的方位关系。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 8,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 9,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_ede9949d",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "而根据研究院的资料，衍光矿中曾发现过来自隧者的外壳部件……",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 9,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 10,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_481c1640",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "「指日石」与衍光矿，朔尔与隧者，神话与现实间千丝万缕的关系为罗伊族的历史蒙上了愈加神秘的面纱。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 10,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 11,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_3889e1d4",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "……",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 11,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 12,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_028af314",
      "type": "text_title",
      "text": "《罗伊人的时间观》节选",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 13,
        "source_type": "文本标题",
        "source_row": 14,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_8d6f2e5f",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "……",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 14,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 15,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_fabcbd8f",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "罗伊人的双历法制度·一",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 15,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 16,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_e75d80e4",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "罗伊人有两套不同的历法，名为巴德历与朔尔历，分别用于日常生活与祭祀活动。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 16,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 17,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_230a816c",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "巴德历来源于人们对于炉芯的观察。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 17,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 18,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_40a52765",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "罗伊人根据炉芯的四种颜色状态，将一日分作金色的昼与黑色的夜，并将年份分为了安稳的「蓝眠之年」以及动荡的「红变之年」。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 18,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 19,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_3d6c3f8c",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "由于此历可以反应炉芯的运作状态，被罗伊族人广泛用于指引农事、放牧和生产等工作。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 19,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 20,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_8af575f7",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "而朔尔历则是罗伊族人的伟大发明，其诞生源于罗伊族人尚且位于地表之时对于太阳轨迹的观测。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 20,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 21,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_195a3296",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "在地表时，古代罗伊人将朔尔历应用于长期的游牧活动之中。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 21,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 22,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_4c4c6925",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "如今，朔尔历虽然与地下世界的运作规律基本无关，但罗伊族人依然使用其作为祭祀等活动的依据。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 22,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 23,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_a97a971b",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "据笔者考察，罗伊人虽早已离开地表来到地下生活，但朔尔历与索拉里斯公历的偏差却不过数日。换言之，旧时罗伊族的天文观测精度便已达到了惊人的水平。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 23,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 24,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_3dc7d42d",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "罗伊人的双历法制度·二",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 24,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 25,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_93eae1bd",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "巴德历与朔尔历，这两种历法每年的日数不同，其年次更迭的频率亦不一致。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 25,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 26,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_850e9f4b",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "但每过一段悠长的时间，巴德历与朔尔历的日期又会再次来到同一点，而这个日期，便是其「三纪神话」中纪元变更的日子。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 26,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 27,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_b213ceb3",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "根据引日殿的观测，如今，第二纪元的尾声已与第三纪元的开端交叠。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 27,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 28,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_8959e30e",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "……",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
